@prefix ahr: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/agent-harness-recompilation#> .

# Qualification-only external fact identity. The nine harness part
# individuals are owned by agent-harness-recompilation-pack, whose
# ontology.ttl types each of them ahr:HarnessPart. This fixture restates
# only those typed identities so the ecc:mapsToPart references resolve
# when ecc-agent-harness-profile-pack is qualified in isolation
# (cross-pack lint law; SLP-QUAL-001 precedent, standing-ladder-pack).
# Mapping these parts never grants semantic equivalence, authority, or
# standing (see pack.toml description).

ahr:adapter a ahr:HarnessPart .
ahr:capabilitySurface a ahr:HarnessPart .
ahr:hook a ahr:HarnessPart .
ahr:learning a ahr:HarnessPart .
ahr:memory a ahr:HarnessPart .
ahr:planning a ahr:HarnessPart .
ahr:securityScanner a ahr:HarnessPart .
ahr:verification a ahr:HarnessPart .
ahr:workflow a ahr:HarnessPart .
